  "headline": "Magnesium sulfate is not on FDA's shortage list today; two hospital sites hold 18 to 28 days of supply and the labeled plant for one NDC shows only VAI inspections through 2025-06-26",
  "headline_cites": ["E11", "E12", "E13", "D1", "D2", "E10", "E9"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's current shortage list contains no entry for magnesium sulfate, only discontinued multi‑electrolyte products from Fresenius Kabi, Fresenius Medical Care, and Vantive.",
      "cites": ["E11", "E12", "E13"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East reports 336 units on hand at 12.2 units per day, giving 28 days of supply.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General reports 235 units on hand at 13.4 units per day, giving 18 days of supply.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The label for NDC 51662135203 identifies HF Acquisition Co LLC (DBA HealthFirst) as the registered plant with FEI 3014534.",
      "cites": ["E10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection records for that FEI show only Voluntary Action Indicated (VAI) classifications, the most recent ending 2025-06-26.",
      "cites": ["E3", "E4", "E5", "E6", "E7", "E8", "E9"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Because the links between the hospital NDCs and the inspected plant are weak, verify the actual manufacturer and lot‑level sourcing for each site's magnesium sulfate inventory.",
      "cites": ["E10", "D1", "D2"]
    }
  ]
}
